  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n# Insurance and Financing - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Making Dental Care Affordable and Accessible\n\n\nSchedule Now\n\n\n# Insurance and Financing - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Making Dental Care Affordable and Accessible\n\n\n\n## Insurance and Financing Options for Any Treatment\n\n\nNo matter what type of treatment or procedure you need, Dental Group of Tysons makes it a priority to offer practical, affordable payment options for patients in any financial situation. Cost should never be a deterrent to receiving quality dental care, and this is something Dr. Esam Nahlah and his team in McLean, VA wholeheartedly believe in. Oral health has a direct correlation to physical health, which makes it even more important to stay on top of your dental health and make sure you get the care you need. No matter your budget limitations or current financial situation, give us a call today and speak with one of our team members about finding an insurance or payment plan that works for you.\n\n\n## Dental Group of Tysons Accepts the Following Forms of Payment:\n\n\nCash\n\nCheck\n\nCredit Card\n\nDental Insurances\n\n3rd Party Financing\n\n\n## Learn About Our Payment and Financing Options\n\n\n\n### Cash, Check, or Credit Card\n\n\nDental Group of Tysons accepts payment via cash, check and credit card (most major credit cards are accepted).\n\n\n### Dental Insurance\n\n\nWe gladly accept most Dental insurance PPO Plans.\n\n\n### CareCredit®\n\n\nPatients eligible for CareCredit financing can manage treatment costs with flexible and affordable monthly payment options. Visit www.carecredit.com or call 1-800-677-0718 for more information.\n\n\n### Proceed Finance\n\n\nPatients with low credit scores can receive affordable, no-collateral loans up to $60,000 with flexible terms up to 96 months at fair, fixed rates. Visit www.proceedfinance.com or call 844-272-7587 for more information.\n\n\n### LendingClub\n\n\nRecognized by Inc. magazine, the New York Times and over 3 million members, Lending Club has refined their process to make it easy on you to pay for dental as well as medical treatments. Apply from your phone within minutes, select the rate, term and payment options that fits your budget, and send cash directly to your account for a lower APR. Visit www.lendingclub.com or call 888-596-3157 for more information.\n\n\n## No Dental Insurance? You've Got Options - Call Us Today.\n\n\nCall Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA today to learn about practical, affordable dental payment options.\n\nBook Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
